{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105","id":3882324322,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc7nZ5Fi","number":14105,"title":"ask_questions tool always returns skipped:true regardless of user input","user":{"login":"vbandi","id":1344888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDQ4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1344888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi","html_url":"https://github.com/vbandi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbandi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-01T16:04:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T00:59:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nThe `ask_questions` tool consistently returns `{\"skipped\":true}` in the function results WITHOUT presenting any UI to the user. The quick pick dialog never appears, and the tool immediately returns as if the user skipped the question.\r\n\r\n## Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Use the `ask_questions` tool with any question and options\r\n2. Observe that no quick pick dialog appears\r\n3. The function result immediately returns with `{\"skipped\":true}`\r\n\r\n## Expected Behavior\r\n\r\n1. A quick pick dialog should appear with the question and options\r\n2. User can select an option or provide free text input\r\n3. The function result should contain either:\r\n   - `{\"selected\": [\"Option Label\"]}` when an option is selected\r\n   - `{\"freeText\": \"user input\"}` when free text is provided\r\n   - `{\"skipped\": true}` only when the user explicitly dismisses/skips the question (ESC key)\r\n\r\n## Actual Behavior\r\n\r\nNo UI is presented to the user. The tool immediately returns:\r\n```json\r\n{\"answers\":{\"Header\":{\"selected\":[],\"freeText\":null,\"skipped\":true}}}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe user has no opportunity to interact with the question.\r\n\r\n## Example Tool Call\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"questions\": [{\r\n    \"allowFreeformInput\": false,\r\n    \"header\": \"Test\",\r\n    \"options\": [\r\n      {\"label\": \"Option A\"},\r\n      {\"label\": \"Option B\"}\r\n    ],\r\n    \"question\": \"Can you select one of these options?\"\r\n  }]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n- OS: Windows\r\n- VS Code: Insiders\r\n- GitHub Copilot: Latest\r\n- Date: February 1, 2026\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n\r\nThis makes the `ask_questions` tool completely non-functional, preventing agents from gathering user preferences or clarifying intent through structured questions. The tool documentation suggests it should present interactive UI, but no UI appears at all.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3880026332","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105#issuecomment-3880026332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14105","id":3880026332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7nRIDc","user":{"login":"pnarimani","id":30625116,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI1MTE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30625116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani","html_url":"https://github.com/pnarimani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnarimani/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T18:41:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T18:41:30Z","body":"This is very annoying. I don't know why this doesn't get any interaction.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/micr